// Charts drawn with vectors, rectangles and ellipse arcs
// Shows: a line chart with area and comparison series, bars that fill their column, a donut with its legend and a progress ring from arcStart / arcSweep / arcInner, a stacked bar, sparklines inside stat cards; the brand series, text and surfaces on tokens so Dark works; the other series keep literal colours, as categorical data does
